{"seq":7,"slug":"remote-sensing","title":"遥感与对地观测","stage":"DONE","category":"geography-geopolitics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 遥感与对地观测 简介\n\n遥感是一门\"不接触就知道\"的学问：在数百公里外的轨道上，靠捕捉地物反射的太阳光、发射的热辐射、回弹的雷达波，反推出地表是什么、有多热、变了多少、储了多少碳。这个 hub 不把遥感讲成一堆零散的卫星和软件操作，而是顺着一条因果链把它讲透——为什么这样设计、每一步在解决什么问题。\n\n整个 hub 由四条主线层层递进，后一条都建立在前一条之上。第一条是物理基础：电磁波谱如何分区、大气在哪些波段透明、地物为何各有独特的光谱\"指纹\"、传感器记录的数字又如何还原成地表的真实物理量。不懂这些，后面一切都是黑箱操作。\n\n第二条是传感器与平台：把物理原理变成硬件。光学多光谱与高光谱如何取舍空间、光谱、时间分辨率，合成孔径雷达如何用微波实现全天候观测，卫星轨道与平台又如何在覆盖范围和重访频率间权衡。这一条回答\"我们用什么、怎样观测\"。\n\n第三条是影像处理与分析：原始影像不能直接用，要先做几何与辐射校正变成\"分析就绪数据\"，再通过分类、变化检测把像素翻译成地物与变化，而深度学习与基础模型正在重写这套方法学。这一条回答\"如何从图像走向理解\"。\n\n第四条是应用领域：把前三条汇向人类真正关心的问题。土地覆盖与农业监测撑起粮食安全，灾害与环境监测在地震洪水火灾时充当全局之眼，气候与碳监测为全球治理提供可独立核验的客观数据。\n\n四条主线不是平行的章节，而是一条从物理到数据、从算法到决策的完整链路。建议初学者顺序通读：先在物理基础建立直觉，再理解传感器为何如此设计，进而掌握处理方法，最后在应用篇看到这一切如何回答现实问题。整个 hub 始终贯穿一个内核——对全球尺度、跨年代、可核验真相的不懈追求。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physics","title":"遥感物理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spectrum-atmosphere","title":"电磁波谱与大气窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/physics/spectrum-atmosphere"},{"seq":2,"slug":"radiative-transfer-calibration","title":"辐射传输与定标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/physics/radiative-transfer-calibration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-signatures","title":"地物光谱反射特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/physics/spectral-signatures"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sensors-platforms","title":"传感器与平台","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/sensors-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optical-hyperspectral","title":"光学多光谱与高光谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/sensors-platforms/optical-hyperspectral"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sar","title":"合成孔径雷达 SAR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/sensors-platforms/sar"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platforms-orbits","title":"平台与轨道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/sensors-platforms/platforms-orbits"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"image-analysis","title":"影像处理与分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/image-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"geometric-radiometric-correction","title":"几何与辐射校正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/image-analysis/geometric-radiometric-correction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classification-change-detection","title":"影像分类与变化检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/image-analysis/classification-change-detection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-learning-rs","title":"深度学习遥感解译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/image-analysis/deep-learning-rs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用领域","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"landcover-agriculture","title":"土地覆盖与农业监测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/applications/landcover-agriculture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"disaster-environment","title":"灾害与环境监测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/applications/disaster-environment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-carbon","title":"气候与碳监测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/applications/climate-carbon"}]}]}